<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.73 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.37 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.38 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Sales		   23.19 vs  17.29</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.71 vs   4.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.88 vs   5.52</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.81 vs   4.32</p>
<p> Sales		  150.48 vs 110.23</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat processing company is</p>
<p>Sokolow SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
